</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"93246\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいつも<ruby>青白<rp>(</rp><rt>あおじろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>顔<rp>(</rp><rt>かお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她总是脸色苍白</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">亜科</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">亚科</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">垢</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">污垢；污物；油垢</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76864\">いつもあかだらけで、<ruby>食事<rp>(</rp><rt>しょくじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>満足<rp>(</rp><rt>まんぞく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>与<rp>(</rp><rt>あた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えられていない<ruby>様子<rp>(</rp><rt>ようす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他总是肮脏 看起来像他没有得到足够的食物。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">赤</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">红；深红；猩红；含红色的颜色（如褐色、粉红色、橙色等）；红色（共产主义者）；红灯（交通）；红字（财务或校对中）；赤字；完全的；彻底的；完美的；明显的；铜；红色五点牌</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"142280\"><ruby>赤<rp>(</rp><rt>あか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>インクで<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いてはいけない。</span><s